    "extraction_notes": [
      "P-channel quantities are stored as positive magnitudes; the original negative signs are preserved in test conditions and axis labels.",
      "The datasheet publishes typical output, transfer, capacitance, and body-diode curves; the 25 degC traces were digitized where the figure provides temperature families.",
      "Capacitance table maximums at VDS = -25 V, VGS = 0 V, f = 1 MHz are Ciss = 1008 pF, Coss = 210 pF, and Crss = 147 pF.",
      "Gate resistance RG is 4.6 ohm typical at VGS = 0 V, VDS = 0 V, f = 1 MHz.",
      "Gate-charge rows: Qg is 4.0 nC typical and 8.0 nC maximum at VDS = -15 V, VGS = -4.5 V, ID = -3.8 A; Qg is 7.8 nC typical at VDS = -15 V, VGS = -10 V, ID = -3.8 A. Qgs is 1.0 nC typical and Qgd is 2.5 nC typical under the latter gate-drive condition.",
      "IDSS maximum is 8.0e-7 A at VDS = -30 V, VGS = 0 V, TJ = 25 degC.",
      "Thermal data publishes RthetaJA = 115 K/W for the specified FR-4 mounting condition; RthetaJC is not published.",
      "No body-diode reverse-recovery time trr or reverse-recovery charge Qrr is published.",
      "The datasheet's transfer figure has multiple ambient-temperature traces; only the TA = 25 degC trace is included for the typical transfer curve.",
      "Curve points are digitized readings from the cited figures and retain the plotted axes and test conditions; no fitted or extrapolated points are included."
    ],
    "omission_reason": "The datasheet does not publish trr/Qrr or RthetaJC; those quantities cannot be extracted from this source."
